<title>ITALY: Italy's Treu confirms welfare talks start June 18.</title>
<headline>Italy's Treu confirms welfare talks start June 18.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Labour Minister Tiziano Treu confirmed on Thursday that the centre-left government planned to start negotiations with trades unions and employers on reforming the welfare state on June 18.</p>
<p>&quot;It should be on (June) 18, we're planning to meet then,&quot; Treu told Reuters at the Chamber of Deputies (lower house).</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
